{"id":"664404","name":"番茄虾滑川粉","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/664404/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虾滑","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"番茄","amount":"适量"},{"name":"川粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"川粉和虾滑备用。","img":"images/664404/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"番茄洗净去皮切片。","img":"images/664404/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中热油放入番茄。","img":"images/664404/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入适量盐。","img":"images/664404/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"翻炒出茄汁。","img":"images/664404/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量清水和少量番茄火锅底料。","img":"images/664404/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"大火煮开5分钟左右。","img":"images/664404/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"虾滑用勺子一个个舀入锅中。","img":"images/664404/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"大火煮开至虾滑断生。","img":"images/664404/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入川粉。","img":"images/664404/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"大火煮开断生即可出锅。","img":"images/664404/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664404/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664404/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}